# Permissions

| Level | Values | Meaning |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Workspace | `owner` | All boards, members, delete workspace |
| Workspace | `editor` | Create boards; only boards they belong to |
| Workspace | `viewer` | No create; only boards they belong to |
| Board | `edit` / `view` | Content + tasks vs read-only |
| Board | `is_board_owner` | Manage board members |

- Workspace owner ⇒ board `edit` without a `board_members` row.
- Use existing helpers in `middleware/permissions.js`. Never trust client-sent `role` / `permission`.
- Assignees must be on the board (or workspace owner).
